"iPhone and iPad backups" = "iPhone 和 iPad 備份";
"Review complete local backups individually. Selected backups move to the Trash after confirmation." = "逐一檢查完整的本地備份。確認後，所選備份將移到垃圾桶。";
"Backup removal is available after the current scan or cleanup finishes." = "當前掃描或清理完成後即可移除備份。";
"Review selected backups" = "檢查所選備份";
"Apple guide" = "Apple 指南";
"This location could not be measured. Permissions or protected system storage may prevent access." = "無法測量此位置，可能是權限或受保護的系統儲存阻止了存取。";
"Dismiss report" = "關閉報告";
"Moving backups to the Trash does not free disk space. Emptying the Trash is a separate action." = "將備份移到垃圾桶不會釋放磁碟空間。清空垃圾桶是單獨的操作。";
"Removing your only backup prevents you from restoring that device from this Mac. Disconnect devices and stop any active backups before continuing." = "移除唯一備份後，你將無法從這台 Mac 恢復該設備。繼續前請斷開設備連接並停止正在進行的備份。";
"PureMac rechecks each selected backup before moving it. Emptying the Trash is a separate action." = "PureMac 會在移動前重新檢查每個所選備份。清空垃圾桶是單獨的操作。";
"Wait for the current scan or cleanup to finish before moving backups." = "請等待當前掃描或清理完成後再移動備份。";
"Siri" = "Siri";
"Apple Intelligence" = "Apple 智能";
"Image Playground & Genmoji" = "圖像樂園與 Genmoji";
"Writing Assistance" = "寫作輔助";
"Writing Tools" = "書寫工具";
"Notification summaries" = "通知摘要";
"Mail summaries" = "郵件摘要";
"Inline text predictions" = "行內文本預測";
"Analytics & Siri recordings" = "分析與 Siri 錄音";
"Personalized Apple ads" = "個性化 Apple 廣告";
"ChatGPT & intelligence extensions" = "ChatGPT 與智能擴展";
"Turn off the assistant and its activation controls." = "關閉助理及其喚醒控制。";
"Review Apple's writing, image and summary features." = "查看 Apple 的寫作、圖像和摘要功能。";
"Restrict image generation using Screen Time." = "使用屏幕使用時間限製圖像生成。";
"Restrict Apple's generated writing features." = "限制 Apple 的生成式寫作功能。";
"Read original notification text without generated summaries." = "查看原始通知文本，而不使用生成的摘要。";
"Turn off generated previews in Apple Mail." = "關閉 Apple 郵件中的生成式預覽。";
"Stop suggested completions appearing as you type." = "輸入時不再顯示建議補全文本。";
"Review diagnostic and voice-recording sharing with Apple." = "檢查與 Apple 共享診斷資料和語音錄音的設定。";
"Turn off interest-based ad targeting by Apple." = "關閉 Apple 基於興趣的廣告定向。";
"Control access to external AI providers." = "控制對外部 AI 提供商的存取。";
"Open Siri and choose Turn Off Siri. Confirm the change. Screen Time also offers Don't Allow Siri." = "打開 Siri，選擇“關閉 Siri”並確認。屏幕使用時間還提供“不允許 Siri”選項。";
"Open Siri or Apple Intelligence & Siri and turn off Ask Siri. On versions that show a Siri section, open it to find the control." = "打開“Siri”或“Apple 智能與 Siri”，關閉“詢問 Siri”。如果當前版本顯示 Siri 部分，請打開該部分查找此開關。";
"macOS 27 uses separate Siri, Screen Time and app controls. Review the individual features below. Turning off Siri does not establish that all Apple Intelligence features are off." = "macOS 27 分別使用 Siri、屏幕使用時間和應用控制。請檢查下方各項功能。關閉 Siri 並不意味著所有 Apple 智能功能均已關閉。";
"Open Apple Intelligence & Siri, turn off Apple Intelligence and confirm. macOS manages downloaded models; PureMac does not promise that this immediately recovers their storage." = "打開“Apple 智能與 Siri”，關閉 Apple 智能並確認。下載的模型由 macOS 管理；PureMac 不保證此操作會立即回收其儲存空間。";
"Open Notifications > Summarize Notifications and turn it off, or choose which apps can use summaries." = "打開“通知 > 摘要通知”並將其關閉，或選擇允許使用摘要的應用。";
"In Mail, choose Mail > Settings > Viewing, then turn off Summarize Message Previews. The button opens Mail; finish the change in its settings." = "在郵件中選擇“郵件 > 設定 > 查看”，然後關閉“摘要郵件預覽”。按鈕會打開郵件，請在其設定中完成更改。";
"Open Keyboard > Text Input > Edit and turn off Show inline predictive text. This setting is separate from Apple Intelligence." = "打開“鍵盤 > 文本輸入 > 編輯”，關閉“顯示行內預測文本”。此設定獨立於 Apple 智能。";
"Open Privacy & Security > Analytics & Improvements. Review Share Mac Analytics, Improve Siri & Dictation and Share iCloud Analytics. Available switches depend on your Mac and account." = "打開“隱私與安全性 > 分析與改進”，檢查“共享 Mac 分析”“改進 Siri 與聽寫”和“共享 iCloud 分析”。可用開關取決於你的 Mac 和賬戶。";
"Open Privacy & Security > Apple Advertising and turn off Personalized Ads. This changes ad targeting; it does not remove advertising or reduce the number of ads." = "打開“隱私與安全性 > Apple 廣告”，關閉“個性化廣告”。此操作會更改廣告定向，但不會移除廣告或減少廣告數量。";
"Open Screen Time > Content & Privacy Restrictions. Enable All Restrictions, then open Siri. These restrictions may apply across devices using your Apple Account. Set Image Creation to Blocked where available. This restricts access; it does not uninstall the protected app or erase images you created." = "打開“屏幕使用時間 > 內容與隱私限制”，啓用“所有限制”，然後打開 Siri。這些限制可能適用於使用你 Apple 賬戶的其他設備。在可用時將“圖像創作”設為“阻止”。這會限制存取，不會卸載受保護的應用或抹掉你創建的圖像。";
"Open Screen Time > Content & Privacy Restrictions. Enable All Restrictions, then open Siri. These restrictions may apply across devices using your Apple Account. Set Writing Assistance to Blocked where available." = "打開“屏幕使用時間 > 內容與隱私限制”，啓用“所有限制”，然後打開 Siri。這些限制可能適用於使用你 Apple 賬戶的其他設備。在可用時將“寫作輔助”設為“阻止”。";
"Open Screen Time > Content & Privacy Restrictions. Enable All Restrictions, then open Siri. These restrictions may apply across devices using your Apple Account. Set Extensions to Blocked. This does not uninstall standalone provider apps." = "打開“屏幕使用時間 > 內容與隱私限制”，啓用“所有限制”，然後打開 Siri。這些限制可能適用於使用你 Apple 賬戶的其他設備。將“擴展”設為“阻止”。這不會卸載提供商的獨立應用。";
"Open Screen Time > Content & Privacy. Enable Content & Privacy restrictions, then open Intelligence & Siri. Turn off Image Creation. This restricts access; it does not uninstall the protected app or erase images you created." = "打開“屏幕使用時間 > 內容與隱私”，啓用內容與隱私限制，然後打開“智能與 Siri”。關閉“圖像創作”。這會限制存取，不會卸載受保護的應用或抹掉你創建的圖像。";
"Open Screen Time > Content & Privacy. Enable Content & Privacy restrictions, then open Intelligence & Siri. Turn off Writing Tools." = "打開“屏幕使用時間 > 內容與隱私”，啓用內容與隱私限制，然後打開“智能與 Siri”。關閉“書寫工具”。";
"Open Screen Time > Content & Privacy. Enable Content & Privacy restrictions, then open Intelligence & Siri. Turn off Intelligence Extensions. You can also open Apple Intelligence & Siri > ChatGPT to review its controls." = "打開“屏幕使用時間 > 內容與隱私”，啓用內容與隱私限制，然後打開“智能與 Siri”。關閉“智能擴展”。你也可以打開“Apple 智能與 Siri > ChatGPT”檢查相關控制。";
